cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: ophys-traces
abstract: Neuropil correction, ΔF/F, calibrated spike rates with CASCADE (CascadeTorch and its pretrained
  models, GCaMP8 models included) and OASIS events from Suite2p output, packaged as a Pennsieve processor;
  writes one NWB ophys file per session (ROI masks, F, neuropil, ΔF/F, CASCADE rate, OASIS events on the
  session clock, with the session's identity), rois.csv and QC figures.
